    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs70fy6I",
      "title": "refactor: remove superchain_level",
      "author": "OptimismBot",
      "number": 1292,
      "body": "## Summary\n\n`superchain_level` is an outdated concept — the Standard / Standard Candidate / Non-Standard rollup-stage classification is no longer consumed by any validation or tooling logic in the registry. The OP Labs team confirmed it can be deleted, so this PR removes it everywhere.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Go (`ops/internal/config`)**\n- Removed the `SuperchainLevel` type, its constants (`SuperchainLevelNonStandard/StandardCandidate/Standard`), the `NewSuperchainLevel` constructor, and the `UnmarshalTOML` method.\n- Removed the `SuperchainLevel` field from the `Chain` and `ChainListEntry` structs and from `Chain.ChainListEntry(...)`.\n- Removed the now-obsolete `TestSuperchainLevel_Marshaling` test (and its unused `strings` import).\n\n**Config + generated summaries**\n- Removed `superchain_level` from every chain config under `superchain/configs/**`.\n- Removed `superchainLevel` / `superchain_level` from the `chainList.json` and `chainList.toml` summaries, and from all Go `testdata`.\n\n**Docs**\n- Removed the \"Superchain Level and Rollup Stage\" section from `docs/glossary.md`.\n- Removed the `superchain_level` line/description from `docs/ops.md`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `grep -ri 'superchain_level\\|superchainLevel'` now returns zero matches across the repo.\n- CI's `check-codegen` job regenerates `chainList.*` and `CHAINS.md` from the configs and confirmed the hand-edited summaries are byte-identical to codegen output.\n- The full codegen run that this PR triggers (all four superchains, since every config changed) surfaced one pre-existing, unrelated piece of on-chain drift: **Ink mainnet (chainId 57073)** transferred its `SystemConfig` owner on-chain to `0x9BA6e03D8B90dE867373Db8cF1A58d2F7F006b3A` (verified via `SystemConfig.owner()` on L1). The second commit syncs `addresses.json` to that live value so `check-codegen` passes. Happy to split it into a separate PR if preferred.\n\nPrompted by: @mds1\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-21T17:56:50Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-07-21T21:13:21Z",
      "additions": 1,
      "deletions": 260
    },
